lly showing clothing cut, polka‑dot print and ruffle layering details. Camera follows her forward movement with small stable amplitude, keeping character centered in frame. Lush green trees and roadside store elements serve as background with moderate depth of field.\n[Shot 2] Smooth continuous shot without cut, camera keeps medium framing. <Subject 1> keeps large‑pace walking, her body sways naturally consistent with high‑heels gait. Sunlight highlights sheer chiffon texture and skirt ruffle layers. Her facial features stay stable, natural relaxed expression, glancing slightly toward camera from time to time, focus on presenting the whole set of outfit dynamic wearing effect.\noverall_soundscape:\nClear sharp high‑heeled boot tapping footsteps on asphalt road, ambient outdoor environment sound, faint leaves rustling in breeze.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nLight moderate‑tempo modern fashion background BGM, soft low‑volume, not overpowering the high‑heel footstep sound effect.\n", 1344, 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 281, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 282, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"name": "audio_vae", "link": 283, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 313, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "link": 288, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "link": 293, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_3", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "label": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_v